Robot model of Mini Pupper 2 (assets/mini_pupper_2/)
====================================================

The URDF files and the meshes/*.stl files in this directory are derived from mini_pupper_description
(mini_pupper_2) in the Mini Pupper ROS 2 stack:

  https://github.com/mangdangroboticsclub/mini_pupper_ros  (commit c3ad28ce3b368fce8c9eb11dca203332bc753a83)

They are distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; a copy is in LICENSE in this directory.

- meshes/*.stl: unmodified copies of the upstream meshes.
- mini_pupper_2_tray*.urdf: modified. The xacro was expanded without ROS; the ros2_control and Gazebo tags and
  the camera placeholder visual were removed; the mesh paths were made relative; the joint damping and friction
  were reduced to 0.01 and 0.005; the body collision mesh was replaced by a box; and a tray (with a payload
  link, bare, or with a cup or glass holder) was added. Each file starts with a comment stating this.

The following files were made for this project and are covered by the MIT License in the repository root:
free_glass.xml, meshes/glass_tube_free.obj, meshes/holder_tube_deep.obj, meshes/holder_tube_glass.obj.

